      `missing`, `malformed-frontmatter`, or `malformed-body`. Sync
      never writes `.mcp.json` when the source file is unusable. The
      malformed-frontmatter case includes presence of any deprecated
      schema field the parser now rejects (`connector`, `rootPath`,
      `entryFile`, `tools`); sync surfaces the parser's reason verbatim
