    - >-
      "A sync verb that overwrites unrelated `.mcp.json` keys. Sync
      mutates `mcpServers.brain` and (during one-way migration)
      removes `mcpServers.obsidian`; every other key is preserved
      verbatim."
    - >-
      "A sync verb that creates a brain.aide if it's missing. Sync's
